      {
        "description": "This archive contains two scripts used to investigate at what conditions oscillations could be found. A script used to determine the obtained oscillations (no, dampened, or sustained) for variations in the input concentrations of Fmoc-piperidine, N-methyl piperidine, phenyl acetate, and nitrophenyl acetate as well as flowrate. As well as the output of these scripts. A script used to determine the obtained oscillations (no, dampened, or sustained) for variations in the input concentrations of Fmoc-piperidine and phenyl acetate at constant input concentrations of N-methyl piperidine, nitrophenyl acetate as well as flowrate. The scripts were written to run parallelized in a Unix environment",
        "label": "Modelling.zip",
